  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SANDEE - Milj&#xF6;ekonomin&#xE4;tverket i Sydasien         2012-2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SANDEE - South Asian Network for Development &amp; Environmental Economics 2012-2015 - SANDEE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SANDEE is a regional network that seeks to strengthen capacity in the area of poverty, economic development and environmental change by     strengthen the ability of researchers in South Asia to undertake      policy relevant research, support the growth of rigorous              policy-relevant literature, support teaching/research insitutions and by  facilitate dialoge among economist and others on environment</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SANDEE &#xE4;r ett regionalt forskningsn&#xE4;tverk som str&#xE4;var efter att       st&#xE4;rka kapaciteten f&#xF6;r forskning som r&#xF6;r fattigdom, ekonomisk         utveckling och milj&#xF6;. Syftet &#xE4;r att st&#xE4;rka sydasiatiska forskares     f&#xF6;rm&#xE5;ga att bedriva policy-relevant forskning, st&#xE4;rka framv&#xE4;xten av   rigor&#xF6;s policy-relevant literatur, st&#xF6;dja undervisnings- och          forskningsinstitutioner, samt underl&#xE4;tta dialogen mellen ekonomer och</narrative>
  </description>
